{
 "schema": "hyperspace.preset/2",
 "name": "lfo-breathe",
 "note": "The macro demo: device knob 1 is Breathe \u2014 the picture brightens and the spin slows as the LFO's swell of the fx mix deepens; the right hand's height deepens LFO 1's pulse.",
